<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52400" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰκουργ-ία</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοεργίη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span> metri gr.], ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wickedness, villainy,
				malice</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς κακοεργίης εὐεργεσίη μέγ́ ἀμείνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.374
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.37
			</span></i>, etc.; of a horse, <i>vice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>malpractices</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κιβδηλεύματά τε καὶ κ. τῶν
					πωλούντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					917e
				</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. καὶ ἀπάται καὶ δολώσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.6.28
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bad workmanship</i>, only in form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοεργία</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				422a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>injury</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἑαυτοῦ
			πόλεως</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				434c
			</span></i>: pl., <i>ill effects</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκρούειν τὰς τῶν φαρμάκων κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.90
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
